otal 优势前提不成立；项目 reframe 而非 kill | mvp-a-oracle-sim |\n43\t| D003 | 2026-05-11 | P2P regression rate 是项目关键前提——≥10% per-test 有效，<5%  | mvp-a-oracle-sim |\n44\t| D002 | 2026-05-11 | MVP-A 有条件通过：F2P-only block-corr 10.88%>5%；需补跑 Tota | mvp-a-oracle-sim |\n45\t| D001 | 2026-05-11 | MVP 方案: Monte Carlo oracle 模拟 + 函数级 pilot，不依赖 Dock | — |\n46\t\n47\t\n48\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5e2ff9bf-0df6-4a54-a6c1-9e43e44e7de7","uuid":"57b336e2-b791-413a-a0e3-931a187e09a5","timestamp":"2026-05-11T21:53:49.269Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_16/projects/exec-sim-repair-verifier/ROADMAP.md","content":"# exec-sim-repair-verifier — Research Dashboard\n\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-11 21:48 UTC | 更新原因: Post-MVP kickoff: paper_framing.md + experiment_plan.yaml 完成，Dream 已提交\n\n## 核心方向\nTask reformulation: 将执行验证从 generation 重构为 classification（predict pass/fail）。详见 paper_framing.md。\n\n## 当前进展\n- **阶段**: Research（post-MVP kickoff 中）\n- **MVP**: 通过 — classification 函数级 acc 87.5%, F1 87.1/87.9%\n- **Framing**: paper_framing.md ✅ | experiment_plan.yaml ✅\n- **Dream**: dream_20260511T214810 pending（full review），等回调后批准 P0 实验\n- **CWM baseline**: PREPARING（训练可能已在 GPU 上完成或运行中，需确认）\n\n## Core Claims (from paper_framing.md)\n1. Classification > Generation（同数据同模型对比）— ⚠️ 待 CWM baseline 验证\n2. Diagnostic signals → targeted re-repair — ⚠️ 待下游实验\n3. Accuracy-utility frontier characterization — ✅ 有模拟数据\n\n## 实验计划 (from experiment_plan.yaml)\n**P0** (~9h GPU): cwm-baseline | trace-then-judge | traj-level-finetuned | per-test-precision-recall | oracle-f2p-stratified\n**P1** (~40h GPU): model-size-scaling | diagnostic-rerepair | swebench-pertest-data | repo-level-training | llm-judge-baseline\n**P2** (~4h GPU): block-corr-empirical | per-test-majority-voting\n**总计**: ~53h RTX 5090（可用 ~336h/14 天，充裕）\n\n## 近期任务\n- [ ] 等 Dream 回调 → 评估 framing/plan 是否需要调整\n- [ ] 确认 CWM baseline 训练状态\n- [ ] Dream 通过后批准 P0 实验组\n- [ ] Agent session 需要重建（当前 found=false）\n\n## GPU 预算\n- 已分配: home-1x5090 cuda:0 (RTX 5090 32GB)\n- P0 实验 ~9h，1 天内可完成\n\n## 关键决策日志\n\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\n|----|------|------|----------|\n| D006 | 2026-05-11 | MVP 通过，进入 Research 阶段；P0 = CWM generation baseline | mvp-b-data-prep, mvp-b-train |\n| D005 | 2026-05-11 | Reframe 后的验证优先级：P0 CWM baseline 对比 > P1 Diagnostic | — |\n| D004 | 2026-05-11 | P2P 回归率 ~1%，原始 Total 优势前提不成立；项目 reframe 而非 kill | mvp-a-oracle-sim |\n| D003 | 2026-05-11 | P2P regression rate 是项目关键前提——≥10% per-test 有效，<5%  | mvp-a-oracle-sim |\n| D002 | 2026-05-11 | MVP-A 有条件通过：F2P-only block-corr 10.88%>5%；需补跑 Tota | mvp-a-oracle-sim |\n| D001 | 2026-05-11 | MVP 方案: Monte Carlo oracle 模拟 + 函数级 pilot，不依赖 Dock | — |\n\n\n","numLines":48,"startLine":1,"totalLines":48}}}
